{"entry":{"id":"l-c1103c03b3ec93f3","lemma":"شَكَرَ","root":"شكر","arabic":"وَٱشْكُرُوا۟","gloss":"and be grateful","transliteration":"wa-ush'kurū","representativeKey":"2:152:3","exampleKeys":["2:152:3","36:73:6","56:70:6"],"occurrenceCount":46,"courseOrder":233,"sourceIds":["qul-56","qul-92","qul-71","qul-75","qul-76","qul-301"],"rootId":"r-7a464ef7653805eb","approval":{"status":"pending"}},"examples":[{"ref":"2:152","tokens":[{"key":"2:152:1","position":1,"arabic":"فَٱذْكُرُونِىٓ","kind":"word","gloss":"So remember Me","transliteration":"fa-udh'kurūnī","lemma":"ذَكَرَ","root":"ذكر","entryId":"l-53d8783c59294aca"},{"key":"2:152:2","position":2,"arabic":"أَذْكُرْكُمْ","kind":"word","gloss":"I will remember you","transliteration":"adhkur'kum","lemma":"ذَكَرَ","root":"ذكر","entryId":"l-53d8783c59294aca"},{"key":"2:152:3","position":3,"arabic":"وَٱشْكُرُوا۟","kind":"word","gloss":"and be grateful","transliteration":"wa-ush'kurū","lemma":"شَكَرَ","root":"شكر","entryId":"l-c1103c03b3ec93f3"},{"key":"2:152:4","position":4,"arabic":"لِى","kind":"word","gloss":"to Me","transliteration":"lī","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null},{"key":"2:152:5","position":5,"arabic":"وَلَا","kind":"word","gloss":"and (do) not","transliteration":"walā","lemma":"لَا","root":null,"entryId":"l-93952243ccc22536"},{"key":"2:152:6","position":6,"arabic":"تَكْفُرُونِ","kind":"word","gloss":"(be) ungrateful to Me","transliteration":"takfurūni","lemma":"كَفَرَ","root":"كفر","entryId":"l-f6f8e55e4806177f"},{"key":"2:152:7","position":7,"arabic":"١٥٢","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}],"translation":"Therefore remember Me (by praying, glorifying), I will remember you, and be grateful to Me (for My countless Favours on you) and never be ungrateful to Me.","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[{"text":"a) See the footnote of (V.13:28). b) Narrated Abu Hurairah رضي الله عنه: The Prophet صلى الله عليه وسلم said, \"Allâh عز وجل says, I am just as My slave thinks I am, (i.e. I am Able to do for him what he thinks I can do for him) and I am with him if he remembers Me. If he remembers Me in himself, I too, remember him in Myself; and if he remembers Me in a group of people, I remember him in a group that is better than them; and if he comes one span nearer to Me, I go one cubit nearer to him; and if he comes one cubit nearer to Me, I go a distance of two outstretched arms nearer to him; and if he comes to Me walking, I go to him running. (Sahih Al-Bukhâri, Vol.9, Hadîth No.502).","ref":{"surah":13,"ayah":28}}],"targetKey":"2:152:3","targetGloss":"and be grateful","targetTransliteration":"wa-ush'kurū","sourceIds":["qul-56","qul-92","qul-71","qul-75","qul-76","qul-301"]},{"ref":"36:73","tokens":[{"key":"36:73:1","position":1,"arabic":"وَلَهُمْ","kind":"word","gloss":"And for them","transliteration":"walahum","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null},{"key":"36:73:2","position":2,"arabic":"فِيهَا","kind":"word","gloss":"therein","transliteration":"fīhā","lemma":"فِى","root":null,"entryId":"l-f0418efd4241a27e"},{"key":"36:73:3","position":3,"arabic":"مَنَـٰفِعُ","kind":"word","gloss":"(are) benefits","transliteration":"manāfiʿu","lemma":"مَنَٰفِع","root":"نفع","entryId":null},{"key":"36:73:4","position":4,"arabic":"وَمَشَارِبُ ۖ","kind":"word","gloss":"and drinks","transliteration":"wamashāribu","lemma":"مَّشْرَب","root":"شرب","entryId":null},{"key":"36:73:5","position":5,"arabic":"أَفَلَا","kind":"word","gloss":"so (will) not","transliteration":"afalā","lemma":"لَا","root":null,"entryId":"l-93952243ccc22536"},{"key":"36:73:6","position":6,"arabic":"يَشْكُرُونَ","kind":"word","gloss":"they give thanks","transliteration":"yashkurūna","lemma":"شَكَرَ","root":"شكر","entryId":"l-c1103c03b3ec93f3"},{"key":"36:73:7","position":7,"arabic":"٧٣","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}],"translation":"And they have (other) benefits from them, and they get (milk) to drink. Will they not then be grateful?","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"targetKey":"36:73:6","targetGloss":"they give thanks","targetTransliteration":"yashkurūna","sourceIds":["qul-56","qul-92","qul-71","qul-75","qul-76","qul-301"]},{"ref":"56:70","tokens":[{"key":"56:70:1","position":1,"arabic":"لَوْ","kind":"word","gloss":"If","transliteration":"law","lemma":"لَو","root":null,"entryId":"l-9e02d9e1c2596c32"},{"key":"56:70:2","position":2,"arabic":"نَشَآءُ","kind":"word","gloss":"We willed","transliteration":"nashāu","lemma":"شَآءَ","root":"شيا","entryId":"l-e6061b9230d95354"},{"key":"56:70:3","position":3,"arabic":"جَعَلْنَـٰهُ","kind":"word","gloss":"We (could) make it","transliteration":"jaʿalnāhu","lemma":"جَعَلَ","root":"جعل","entryId":"l-784f751d925aef34"},{"key":"56:70:4","position":4,"arabic":"أُجَاجًۭا","kind":"word","gloss":"salty","transliteration":"ujājan","lemma":"أُجَاج","root":"اجج","entryId":null},{"key":"56:70:5","position":5,"arabic":"فَلَوْلَا","kind":"word","gloss":"then why are you not grateful","transliteration":"falawlā","lemma":"لَوْلَآ","root":null,"entryId":"l-3c9deff96e0632a2"},{"key":"56:70:6","position":6,"arabic":"تَشْكُرُونَ","kind":"word","gloss":"then why are you not grateful","transliteration":"tashkurūna","lemma":"شَكَرَ","root":"شكر","entryId":"l-c1103c03b3ec93f3"},{"key":"56:70:7","position":7,"arabic":"٧٠","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}],"translation":"If We willed, We verily could make it salt (and undrinkable): why then do you not give thanks (to Allâh)?","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"targetKey":"56:70:6","targetGloss":"then why are you not grateful","targetTransliteration":"tashkurūna","sourceIds":["qul-56","qul-92","qul-71","qul-75","qul-76","qul-301"]}]}